<title>USA: Lunar authorizes one mln share buyback.</title>
<headline>Lunar authorizes one mln share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>MADISON, Wis. 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lunar Corp said Tuesday its directors authorized the company to repurchase, from time to time, up to one million shares of the company's common stock.</p>
<p>At March 31, 1997 when the company's third quarter ended, there were 8,714,350 average shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Lunar develops products for the diagnosis and monitoring of osteoporosis and other diseases.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
